t in 4.2stable & below.\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.stable - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - Quadro RTX 5000 with Max-Q Design - Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-10850H CPU @ 2.70GHz (12 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\n### Observed Issue:\nLoading a `.build` file in the Engine Compilation Configuration Editor tool (found in `Project -> Tools`) simply does nothing & does not load the build file.\nEvery other option (\"New\", \"Save\", & \"Save As\") work as intended however it is only the load option I am having issues with.\nIf you edit the `.build` in a text editor you can see the settings are in fact saved in the file & should be valid.\n\n### Expected Behavior:\nUpon clicking \"Load\" it should load the configuration from the selected `.build` file.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Open \"Project\" options at the top of the editor.\n- Hover over \"Tools\" until more options show up.\n- Select the \"Engine Compilation Configuration Editor\" option.\n- Remove any of the profile's included classes.\n- Click \"Save As\" to save the `.build` file.\n- Click \"New\" again to reset the selected classes.\n- Click \"Load\" to observe your build profile does not load.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nNo project as this is the base Godot editor with no extensions or plugins.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.co